{
  "title": "Namaz of Tuesdays",
  "code": "2",
  "data": "Imam al-Hasan al-’Askari (a.s.) is also reported to have said that whoever offers on Tuesdays a six unit prayer; reciting in each unit [Surah al-Faatehah](A5), the last two verses of [Surah al-Baqarah](A6) (i.e. aamana al-rasoolo), and [Surah al-Zalzalah](A103), Almighty Allah will forgive all of his sin as if his mother has just given birth to him."
}
